# NOTE ON DATASETS
# real_federated_data/, malisious/ and the source .csv/.xlsx are intentionally
# tracked so the project runs out of the box. If you would rather regenerate
# them, uncomment the block below and run scripts/load_filtered_data.py ->
# scripts/generate_embeddings.py -> scripts/make_malicious_clients.py.
#
# real_federated_data/
# malisious/
# *.npz
# filtered_training_data.csv
# clean_spam_dataset.csv
# Augmented_SpamHamTweets.xlsx

